# PHASE 5 – PROJECT DEVELOPMENT

## 1. Introduction

The Project Development Phase is the main implementation phase of the Employee Data Import and Management System.

In this phase, the requirements and design identified in the previous phases are implemented using ServiceNow. Employee information is prepared in spreadsheet format, imported into ServiceNow, mapped to the target fields, transformed, and verified.

---

## 2. Development Environment

The project was developed using the following tools and technologies:

* ServiceNow Developer Instance
* Microsoft Excel / Spreadsheet
* Web Browser
* Import Sets
* Transform Maps
* ServiceNow Tables
* GitHub

---

## 3. Creating the Employee Test Table

A custom table named **Employee Test** was created in ServiceNow to store employee information.

The table contains the following fields:

| Field Name    | Purpose                                   |
| ------------- | ----------------------------------------- |
| Employee ID   | Stores the unique employee identification |
| Employee Name | Stores the employee name                  |
| Department    | Stores the employee department            |
| Email         | Stores the employee email                 |
| Location      | Stores the employee location              |

The Employee Test table acts as the target table for the imported employee information.

